["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/Dimensions", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Dimensions generally refer to measurable extents or attributes that define the size, shape, or scale of an object, system, or concept.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
